{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volstead City is rotten and dangerous. Your brother\u2014once the top bootlegger in town\u2014was arrested in a police raid. Now it\u2019s your turn to take over. As Potbellied Racoon and his men try to seize control of the city, you\u2019ll need to dodge both the cops and the criminals while uncovering the truth behind your brother\u2019s arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your brand, grow your crops, craft your booze, and meet eccentric customers across the city. Complete their quirky missions, build relationships, and grow your underground empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e80858f89eb595f00816e5c417b54c3b.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e80858f89eb595f00816e5c417b54c3b.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beer to hard liquors \u2014 grow your ingredients and master the machines to craft a wide variety of drinks. Ferment, distill, barrel-age, and infuse flavors to create truly unique bottles then automate it all for maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fd123ecef252e6cee35c56d2df4042cd.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fd123ecef252e6cee35c56d2df4042cd.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own label, slap it on the bottle, and let the streets of Volstead know your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d81e05029bdd086f03ccc212ffb6d16b.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/d81e05029bdd086f03ccc212ffb6d16b.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three seasonal regions, drive unique vehicles, uncover neighborhoods, and meet a cast of colorful NPCs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/3a96590598a1148fb317666ab7598192.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/3a96590598a1148fb317666ab7598192.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region has its own unique demands and preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver the right drinks to the right neighborhoods, strengthen your contacts, and expand your network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through the districts, grow your influence, and become the one who runs the entire town.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/be951304dbd2af560dabb8f39331860f.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/be951304dbd2af560dabb8f39331860f.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Volstead\u2019s streets are more than just business. Gangs make their own rules, and mistakes are never forgiven. Stay sharp, know who you\u2019re dealing with, and stay alert if you want to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916860?t=1767369361","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/216ba5305446e84fa8ccd073a09b2c31f6da3ff2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767369361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/7254f441f757f39c0027bcf2dbb1fd19da3c93d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767369361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/7254f441f757f39c0027bcf2dbb1fd19da3c93d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767369361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains alcohol consumption, illegal alcohol production and sales, sexual innuendo, and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/6423983393a9d69a090a01dc87c20cb7.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volstead City is rotten and dangerous. Your brother\u2014once the top bootlegger in town\u2014was arrested in a police raid. Now it\u2019s your turn to take over. As Potbellied Racoon and his men try to seize control of the city, you\u2019ll need to dodge both the cops and the criminals while uncovering the truth behind your brother\u2019s arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your brand, grow your crops, craft your booze, and meet eccentric customers across the city. Complete their quirky missions, build relationships, and grow your underground empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e80858f89eb595f00816e5c417b54c3b.poster.avif?t=1767369361\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/e80858f89eb595f00816e5c417b54c3b.webm?t=1767369361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beer to hard liquors \u2014 grow your ingredients and master the machines to craft a wide variety of drinks. Ferment, distill, barrel-age, and infuse flavors to create truly unique bottles then automate it all for maximum profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916860/extras/fd123ecef252e6cee35c56d2df4042cd.poster.avif?t=17